      }
    },
    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_2",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Moby Dick is an unfinished film by Orson Welles, filmed in 1971. It is not to be confused with the incomplete (and now lost) 1955 film Welles made of his meta-play \"Moby Dick—Rehearsed\", or with Moby Dick (1956 film), in which Welles played a supporting role.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
